  "_readme": [
    "The controls Studio, Dev and Lab offered before AMV-D007 merged them into one",
    "Build surface. Captured by driving the real app, not by reading the markup.",
    "",
    "This file exists so that a merge cannot quietly drop functionality. Every",
    "entry must still be reachable somewhere after the merge. If a control is",
    "deliberately removed, delete its line AND lower the counts below in the same",
    "commit - that makes the removal a visible act rather than a green test.",
    "",
    "'rendered' is what a person can reach by operating the app. 'operable_ids' is",
    "every id the three render functions put on something clickable, including the",
    "five that are invisible by design (hidden file inputs, a hidden language",
    "select, and Save which appears only once a folder is connected) - driving",
    "cannot find those, so they are checked against the built bundle instead."
  ],
